== Migrating or importing OSCAR 1.x data ==
If you have previously used OSCAR 1.x, OSCAR provides two options to bring your existing data across from older versions to OSCAR 2.0:
* '''Migrate''' your profiles and data from OSCAR 1.x - this is only done once during installation and copies all your OSCAR data, profiles, and settings to the new OSCAR 2.0 data folder. Data is updated as required to reflect changes between OSCAR 1.x and OSCAR 2.0.  This is the recommended procedure for the majority of users. 
** Details here: [[Migrating OSCAR 1.x Data]]

* '''Import''' your data from an OSCAR 1.x profile - this can be done anytime after OSCAR 2.0 has been installed and run. Importing the data brings the entire profile and settings from your OSCAR 1.x database. This process is a little more convoluted and is only recommended for users who are comfortable importing data from files on their computer.
** Details here: [[Importing OSCAR 1.x Data]]

Note that both Migrate and Import leave the existing OSCAR 1.x data untouched so you can still use OSCAR 1.x if you wish to.